The repository structure, manifest-driven adapter approach, file-backed state,
and CLI conventions were inspired by agentic-stack, authored by Avidlive:
https://github.com/codejunkie99/agentic-stack

The optional agentic-stack integration (docs/integrations/agentic-stack.md)
reads agentic-stack's documented file layout and runs its own track.py; it
was written from agentic-stack's repository at commit
11a75e16b6cb08a436b3124474273fdb9f08b4de.

agent-autosave is an independent implementation. No agentic-stack source code
was copied. This attribution acknowledges design inspiration, not affiliation
or endorsement.
